deno.com/blog/v1.12\u003e","ts":"1626187806.113800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Deno 1.12 Release Notes","id":1,"title":"Deno 1.12 Release Notes","title_link":"https://deno.com/blog/v1.12","text":"The Deno 1.12 release adds new web crypto APIs, improves web workers and WebAssembly integration, and adds WebSocket support to the native HTTP server.","image_url":"https://deno.com/v1.12/header.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"deno.com","service_icon":"https://deno.com/static/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://deno.com/blog/v1.12","original_url":"https://deno.com/blog/v1.12"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1UP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8bee8a0-cbda-49db-87df-fa12c11242a2","type":"message","user":"UMQ5RBYSH","text":"これですかね？まだ Draft ですが\n\u003chttps://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/36328\u003e","ts":"1626170385.113500","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/36328|#36328 Https imports\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/36328|#36328 Https imports\u003e","text":"This allows for HTTPS (not HTTP) imports to work with the ESM module loader. It Is NOT READY. This PR is meant to allow for discussion and showing some refactoring issues going on.\n\n*Supported concerns*\n\n☑︎ Disabled by default - requires `--experimental-https-modules` flag\n☑︎ Redirects - act like web\n☑︎ Selective HTTP support - only works on loopback\n☑︎ Debugging HTTPS on a local machine is painful - use loopback + `http:`\n☑︎ Cannot access `node:` builtins - banned anything except `http:` and `https:` deps.\n\n*Punted concerns*\n\n• Offline cache - punted to follow on work\n• Integrity checks - left as follow on work via `policies`\n• CORS - not supported\n• CA - TBD follow on work\n• Cookies - TBD follow on work\n• MIME parsing - wontfix / still broken since we don't have a real parser in core, I'm not gonna try to get `mime` landed anytime soon due to pushbacks\n\n*Documentation*\n*Checklist*\n\n☑︎ `make -j4 test` (UNIX), or `vcbuild test` (Windows) passes\n☑︎ tests and/or benchmarks are included\n☑︎ documentation is changed or added\n☐ commit message follows \u003chttps://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/master/doc/guides/contributing/pull-requests.md#commit-message-guidelines|commit guidelines\u003e","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"esm, modules-agenda, wip","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"71","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/nodejs/node|nodejs/node\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1606754839}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SHuez"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4a360c9-70f5-4410-aa84-0f5db50d3080","type":"message","user":"U016XJSPYD8","text":"今検索してみたらwebpackのloaderしか出てきませんした。\nどこかでURL importに対応したとか聞いた気がしたのだが、気のせいだったか","ts":"1626163047.113100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7nM9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1718231-2414-4d31-80f1-0bd57f817950","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"できない気がするけどどうだろう、webpackでloaderが処理してくれそうな気もする","ts":"1626162876.111600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9zTQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db039c83-65b6-48dd-94f8-8aad33222a53","type":"message","user":"U016XJSPYD8","text":"あ、最近のnodeだとURL importもできたっけ？","ts":"1626162835.111200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c+n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29116625-6aa6-4f5f-8ab5-ac70e1881e39","type":"message","user":"U016XJSPYD8","text":"おとなしくyarn使うかなあ……\nでもdenoだとURL importでscrapboxとかに書き散らしたcodeを即実行できるので楽なんですよね","ts":"1626162810.110300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MByqM"}]},{"clien